<title>POLAND: PBR SWINGS TO PLN 0.5 MLN PROFIT IN OCT.</title>
<headline>PBR SWINGS TO PLN 0.5 MLN PROFIT IN OCT.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit					  0.5  vs    4.78 loss</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    1.93 vs    0.65 loss</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		  4.66 vs    3.54</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	13.32 vs   11.11</p>
<p>JANUARY-OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit					 22.71 vs    8.66</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   40.30 vs   23.80</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 73.40 vs   56.99</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     160.62 vs  126.08</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Polski Bank Rozwoju SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
